  "summary": "Malicious code in felix-spin (npm)",
  "details": "Felix-spin@1.0.0 is an inert npm package that ships no functional code: its index.js is an empty module (module.exports = {}) and it declares no lifecycle scripts, executables, or dependencies. The package's only substantive content is a French-language README that functions as casino-affiliate search-engine spam for \"Felix Spin Casino\", embedding an image hosted on i[.]ibb[.]co and linking to felixspin-fr[.]fr. The package is a placeholder publish used to seed spam content into the npm registry.",
